<LST>*Total cementitious material also includes <RID>ASTM C150/C150M</RID>, <RID>ASTM C595/C595M</RID>, <RID>ASTM C845/C845M</RID>, and <RID>ASTM C1157/C1157M</RID> cement.  The maximum 
percentages above must include:</LST><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<ITM>i. Fly ash or other pozzolans present in <RID>ASTM C1157/C1157M</RID> or <RID>ASTM C595/C595M</RID> Type IP or Type IT blended cement.</ITM><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<ITM>ii. Slag cement present in <RID>ASTM C1157/C1157M</RID> or <RID>ASTM C595/C595M</RID> Type IS or Type IT blended cement.</ITM><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<ITM>iii. Silica fume conforming to <RID>ASTM C1240</RID> present in <RID>ASTM C1157/C1157M</RID> or <RID>ASTM C595/C595M</RID> Type IP or Type IT blended cement.</ITM><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<LST>^Fly ash or other pozzolans and silica fume must constitute no more than 25 percent and 10 percent, respectively, of the total mass of 
the cementitious materials.</LST><BRK/></OLG>
